The files in this directory (base_utils.py, insulin_processing.py) are adapted
from the netIOB T1DEXI processing utilities by the CeADAR Connect Group,
CeADAR - Ireland's Centre for AI, described in:

  Lewis DM, et al. Data Processing and Best Practices in Large-Scale Diabetes
  Datasets. Preprint.

They were obtained from the netIOB GitLab repository,
https://gitlab.com/CeADARIreland_Public/netiob (not installed from the
`netiob` PyPI package), and are distributed under the Apache License, Version
2.0 (see LICENSE in this directory). Changes made in this copy are listed in
each file's module docstring.

That repository is no longer reachable. The PyPI release
`netiob` 0.1.1 (https://pypi.org/project/netiob/0.1.1/) lists the same
maintainer, contributors, homepage and license as this code and is believed
to be the same project, though the exact commit used here was not confirmed
byte-identical to that release.
